tool: port
n1: 1
n2: 2
kind: y
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


[AS7's Example 19.4 (y parameters around a dependent source)]

r1,1,2,8
r2,2,0,2
r3,2,3,4
j,2,3,2*ir1

analysis: dc
note: Determine the y parameters of the two-port with a dependent source inside. A two-port equivalent works perfectly well around a controlled source.
tool: port
n1: 1
n2: 3
kind: y
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


